Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tencent-connect/qqbot-nodejs
License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Tencent

Included units:
- vendor/qqbot-gateway: gateway-connection, codec, constants, errors,
  event-dispatcher and reconnect. Only the ws import is redirected to the
  vendored ws package.
- vendor/qqbot-media: the buffer-input chunked upload protocol, its upload-only
  retry engine, route templates, required types and formatting utilities.
  Adaptations connect the existing client/token to AbortSignal cancellation,
  validate prepare responses, limit response buffering and wait for concurrent
  part cleanup. Local-path input and upload caches are not included.
- lib/official-references.mjs: bounded ref-index association adapted from the
  SDK's middleware/quote-ref; keys additionally include chat/topic identity.

